{"hymn":"S279","parent":"E343","quality":"adapted","adjust":{"hold":0,"merge":2},"title":"En mi alma ahora brilla el sol","subtitle":"La certeza y el gozo de la salvación—General","syl":{"n1":"En","n2":["mi‿al","i"],"n3":["ma‿a","m"],"n4":["ho","m"],"n5":["ra","t"],"n6":["bri","i"],"n7":["lla‿el","t"],"n8":"sol","n9":"Con","n10":"más","n12":["glo","i"],"n13":["ria‿y","t"],"n14":["ful","i"],"n15":["gor","t"],"n16":"Que","n17":"luz","n19":"del","n20":["cie","i"],"n21":["lo","t"],"n22":["te","i"],"n23":["rre","m"],"n24":["nal","t"],"n25":"Pues","n26":"mi","n27":"luz","n28":"es","n29":"mi","n30":["Se","i"],"n31":["ñor.","t"],"n32":"Luz","n33":["ben","i"],"n34":["di","m"],"n35":["ta,","t"],"n37":"luz","n38":["ben","i"],"n39":["di","m"],"n40":["ta","t"],"n41":"Oh","n42":"qué","n43":"paz,","n44":"oh","n45":"qué","n46":["fe","i"],"n47":["li","m"],"n48":["ci","m"],"n49":["dad","t"],"n51":["Cuan","i"],"n52":["do","t"],"n53":"veo","n54":["la‿son","i"],"n55":["ri","m"],"n56":["sa","t"],"n58":["de‿Je","i"],"n60":["sús","t"],"n61":"En","n62":"mi","n63":["al","i"],"n64":["ma‿hay","t"],"n65":"luz","n66":"del","n67":"sol."},"verses":[{"label":"2.","lines":["En mi alma hay una canción,","Es música‿a mi Rey;","Y aun si no puedo cantar,","Jesús me‿escucha bien."]},{"label":"3.","lines":["En mi alma primavera hay","Pues cuando‿Él cerca está,","Mi corazón entona paz;","¡Hay gracia sin igual!"]},{"label":"4.","lines":["En mi alma‿alegre hay loor,","Esperanza y amor","Porque hoy y siempre mi Señor","Es mi gozo‿y bendición."]}]}